{"skill":{"slug":"google-sheets","displayName":"google-sheets"},"version":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790937924514,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":53976,"sha256":"26a325aea7d288ae20a5b8a4ecb9c51426241d770916e9e67318e027d29194fb","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2136,"sha256":"e0eca1a00e82283de7f3cf769787bb7a210bae8f2947edda62d9959aa1b25347","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790938466416,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"a5a48311e2b0d5143af9df6cd72f19fa1ed23c978930aeb9403ecda2449dae2c","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/a5a48311e2b0d5143af9df6cd72f19fa1ed23c978930aeb9403ecda2449dae2c","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790938312992},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790938466416},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed Google Sheets integration that uses Maton OAuth/CLI access and includes appropriate cautions for writes, credentials, hosted functions, and persistent triggers.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill uses local Bash and network access, stores Maton OAuth tokens in the OS credential store, and provides an API-key fallback only for environments without the CLI; these are sensitive but clearly explained and bounded.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation requires the Maton CLI via pinned npm or Homebrew commands and network access; this is disclosed and proportionate for a managed OAuth API integration.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The instructions repeatedly default to read/list actions, require explicit user approval for connection creation and writes, scope ambiguous accounts/connections, and treat third-party API data as untrusted.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"OAuth sessions, hosted functions, and triggers can persist beyond a single run, but the artifact discloses this, requires separate approval for deploys/triggers/destinations, recommends DENY_ALL networking for functions, and describes cleanup/deletion.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is to read and write Google Sheets through Maton, and the documented capabilities match that purpose: spreadsheet reads/writes, sheet creation, formatting, ranges, and optional automation around approved Google Sheets actions.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable authorizing Maton to access the Google Sheets account you choose. Confirm every write, connection, function deployment, trigger, and destination explicitly, prefer read-only scopes when possible, and avoid API-key fallback unless the CLI cannot be used.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790938466416}}}}}